                  </content>
               </title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>D&amp;C red #27 aluminum lake, D&amp;C red #30 aluminum lake, dextrates hydrated, ethylcellulose, FD&amp;C blue #1 aluminum lake, flavor, hydroxypropyl cellulose, magnesium stearate, mannitol, stearic acid, sucralose, sucrose<br/>
                  </paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20260622"/>
            </section>
         </component>
